# Copy to Config/Signing.xcconfig (gitignored) and set the team to sign with.
#
# A free personal team is enough for this app: background audio, Keychain, the
# CarPlay audio category and a Share extension all work without paid
# entitlements. The id stays out of the repository because it is a personal
# identifier, not a project constant.
#
# On a free personal team the id to put here is the TeamIdentifier (the "O=" of
# the profile), not the one in the certificate's common name — they differ.
DONI_TEAM_ID=
